eaca-6a5f-4242-9063-4b570e206e97", "type": "concept", "title": "Capacity, consent, surrogate decisions, ethics consultation, and goals of care"}]}, {"id": "69613856-6ca9-48b3-9a02-13af6ba60a1a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Equity and data stewardship", "description": "Students recognize structural barriers and protect sensitive clinical information.", "children": [{"id": "be38126c-ea12-4e07-81be-bc44dd017d75", "type": "concept", "title": "Food insecurity, racism, ableism, weight stigma, language, geography, insurance, and supply access"}, {"id": "2eeb4c24-b3e8-45a3-ad40-77a52de0fa6c", "type": "concept", "title": "Trauma-informed, culturally responsive, gender-affirming, and disability-inclusive care"}, {"id": "d7be5708-aa1c-4245-9bbe-120936a20c1b", "type": "concept", "title": "EHR provenance, copied errors, privacy, cybersecurity, AI verification, and no identifiable data in public tools"}]}, {"id": "8ce50d11-23a8-4c70-bc03-6fd75600e35b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Safe transitions", "description": "Students prevent technically correct plans from failing after transfer or discharge.", "children": [{"id": "4d104a61-e284-4145-b122-49ae1618f9f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication/diet reconciliation, route/access, formula, supplies, storage, food safety, and equipment"}, {"id": "4c447658-b45a-42bb-849a-cb86a0d9f19e", "type": "concept", "title": "Teach-back, caregiver competency, written emergency plans, warning signs, and contact pathways"}, {"id": "45d03cc5-ad9e-4bcd-9192-3c5c2cf64809", "type": "concept", "title": "Follow-up timing, laboratory monitoring, prescription ownership, coverage, and home services"}]}]}, {"id": "430d88c1-0392-4d5d-beb2-dfda12308ec8", "type": "topic", "title": "Complex Case Presentation and Evidence Integration", "description": "The culminating case requires students to defend a safe, measurable, evidence-informed plan for a patient with interacting diseases and changing goals.", "children": [{"id": "8d1180ed-82b5-4ff1-a57e-826035e90795", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Problem representation and calculations", "description": "Students present only the information needed to understand and act.", "children": [{"id": "41497126-8022-4b2c-9c2f-ffdb2e9dc349", "type": "concept", "title": "Timeline, severity, nutrition status, organ support, medications, psychosocial context, and goals"}, {"id": "8ecfcde5-14b1-4b98-98ae-863f63de47be", "type": "concept", "title": "Energy/protein/fluid and EN/PN calculations with units, assumptions, and plausibility checks"}, {"id": "4a70ec67-4bba-4607-a6ae-c94db32f692f", "type": "concept", "title": "Prioritized nutrition diagnoses, alternative explanations, red flags, and consultations"}]}, {"id": "0e5ee85d-289a-4a18-bfd6-c63c31a4b515", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence-to-decision synthesis", "description": "Students compare current guidance and explain why it does or does not fit.", "children": [{"id": "f26e7001-fed4-444f-aac7-f052cdb6c2ef", "type": "concept", "title": "Focused question, search, guideline date, recommendation strength, systematic reviews, and primary evidence"}, {"id": "2d11153b-4df8-4891-9121-daaa5bcc43e4", "type": "concept", "title": "Bias, certainty, directness, magnitude, feasibility, equity, cost, and preferences"}, {"id": "e0e2d0ee-502a-45fb-b877-975e85e1a235", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflicting recommendations, institutional policy, shortages, and transparent rationale"}]}, {"id": "c5394233-075c-44fe-b33e-68af3a19ecd6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Conference, monitoring, and revision", "description": "Students communicate uncertainty and update the plan after feedback or clinical change.", "children": [{"id": "7f6092db-77d4-400a-b3a7-b183ba439f7c", "type": "concept", "title": "Concise oral presentation, visual trends, patient voice, options, and recommendation"}, {"id": "438bd373-d995-4354-b3fe-09f8566acc3d", "type": "concept", "title": "Monitoring matrix, adverse events, stop/escalation rules, discharge, and ownership"}, {"id": "189b5530-5d48-49ac-b95a-f73e56adf82b", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer/team critique, reflection, scope limits, revised note, and continuity plan"}]}]}], "dbBacked": true}$mnt2json$::jsonb,
